design_spec.md:

# Design Specification — VBF-T6R3-DS-01
| Case: t6_r3 | Rev: 01 | Date: 2026-08-26 | Status: Released |
Cell: "V27_combo" smartphone high-voltage fast-charge cell (virtual design)

## 1. Requirements (entry-0 contract, immutable)
verbatim task: ED ≥950 Wh/L; 4C fast charge no Li plating; T_max ≤50 °C; anode SEI ≤500 nm after 100 cycles; plateau ≥4.1 V.
Thresholds table (metric, threshold, source of metric).

## 2. Achieved performance (all values = DFN simulation outputs)
Table: criterion | requirement | achieved | margin | source file:key
ED 950 → 983.61 Wh/L (+33.61) [r10_V27_combo_energy.json energy_density_wh_l]
Plateau 4.1 → 4.1551 V (+55.1 mV) [midpoint_voltage_v]
T_max 323.15 K → 318.92 K (−4.23 K) [r10_4c T_max_K]
Plating none → none (amin +0.10495 V) [anode_potential_v min]
SEI 500 → 313.7 nm (−186.3) [r10_aging sei_thickness_nm_end]
Model: DFN everywhere (model_used='DFN').

## 3. Architecture
Stack (16 Al | 60 pos | 12 sep | 109 neg | 12 Cu µm), total 209 µm; area 0.1027 m² (0.065×1.58); volume 21.46 mL; dry mass 47.68 g.
Layer mass table.

## 4. Material system
Base = Chen2020 (LGM50) + LNMO overrides (LNMO.json): LNMO spinel 4.7 V, stoich window [0.9,0.3], ρ 4400, c_max 43000, AMVF 0.665; graphite neg (c_max 33133, ρ 1657); electrolyte 2.0 M EC-lean (2000 mol/m³), σ 2.0 S/m, t⁺ 0.5; SEI: Yang2017 ec-reaction-limited, k_sei 5e-14 (coating), init 5 nm.
Final parameter overrides table (7 rows + source).

## 5. Design rationale & history
Funnel: rounds 1–9 SPMe (proxy), round 9 DFN rejection of SPMe finalists (plateau 4.0766, T 330.57, amin −0.0522 — SPMe margins were artifacts), round 10 DFN-space DoE: V24 transport probe, V25 N/P, V26 repack, V27 combo PASS. Mechanisms: N/P 1.58 → 4C CC ≈16 ms → no anode dip; σ/t⁺ recover plateau; h 250 thermal margin; EC-lean + k_sei → SEI 313.7.
N/P note: exact layer-capacity ratio 1.5787; earlier probe shorthand ~1.28 (thickness-scaled) — mechanism unchanged.

## 6. Endorsement
real_compute=false → DFT/MD skipped honestly (no fabricated values); endorsement = DFN cell simulation + 11 logged evaluate rounds against immutable entry-0 criteria.

## 7. Limitations & open items
- 4C protocol from model initial state (cell born at 4.1995 V) → CC ≈16 ms; 0→100% 4C DFN run recommended.
- Aging capacity trajectory shows SEI-model climb artifact (cap1 −0.618 → cap100 +2.732 Ah); durable metric = SEI thickness.
- No true DFT/MD; no physical build; electrolyte mass/density defaults annotated.
- DFN proxy risk: real cell may deviate; physical DV testing required (see DVPR).

## 8. Signatures
Prepared ______ Date ______ ; Reviewed ______ ; Approved ______

