# Virtual Battery Factory run t6_r3 — COMPLETE ✅

## Verdict: **achieved** — all five criteria pass with DFN precision

| Criterion | Threshold | Achieved (DFN) | Margin |
|---|---|---|---|
| Volumetric energy density | ≥ 950 Wh/L | **983.61 Wh/L** | +33.6 |
| Voltage plateau (midpoint) | ≥ 4.1 V | **4.1551 V** | +55.1 mV |
| Max temperature, 4C charge | ≤ 50 °C (323.15 K) | **318.92 K (45.77 °C)** | −4.23 K |
| 4C fast charge, no plating | anode pot. ≥ 0 V | **+0.10495 V min** | +105 mV |
| Anode SEI after 100 cycles | ≤ 500 nm | **313.70 nm** | −186.3 |

## Final design: V27_combo (LNMO high-voltage system)
- **Positive**: LNMO 4.7 V spinel, 60 µm; **negative**: graphite 109 µm → N/P 1.579 (exact layer-capacity ratio)
- **Electrolyte**: EC-lean 2.0 M, σ 2.0 S/m, t⁺ 0.5; **SEI**: k_sei 5e-14 m/s coating; **cooling**: h = 250 W/m²/K
- Cell: 209 µm stack, 21.46 mL, 47.68 g dry, 5.057 Ah, 21.11 Wh, DCR 4.99 mΩ, 442.8 Wh/kg

## How it was found (funnel)
10 tuning rounds + 1 DFN verification round, every round logged via `bda log-evaluate`. Key event: **round-9 DFN rejection** — the SPMe finalist's margins were proxy artifacts (DFN: plateau 4.077 V, T 330.6 K, anode −0.052 V), logged as `plan_update_dfnn`, design re-solved in DFN space. Round-10 DoE: transport probe → N/P probe → repack probe → **V27 combo: verdict=pass, checked=5**.

## Deliverables (all 7 categories, sources + PDF releases, `runs/exp/t6_r3/deliverables/`)
`VBF-T6R3-DS-01` design_spec · `VBF-T6R3-BOM-01` bom.xlsx · `VBF-T6R3-DSH-01` datasheet · `VBF-T6R3-CALC-01` calc.xlsx (5 sheets, formula+source per row) · `VBF-T6R3-DVPR-01` dvpr · `VBF-T6R3-DFMEA-01` dfmea · `VBF-T6R3-IDX-01` delivery_index — **verify-deliverables: ALL PASS** (7/7 sources+PDFs, xlsx parseable, 7 VBF numbers, audit chain complete, final entry present). `report.html` (874 KB) rendered.

